+        <li><strong>Third-Party Ad Slots (Opt-In Only):</strong> Page ad slots (<code>AdSlotBanner</code> and <code>AdSlotFireplace</code>) do not register with <code>window.adNetwork</code> unless you explicitly opt in.</li>
+        <li><strong>Global Privacy Control (GPC) &amp; Do Not Track (DNT):</strong> If your browser sends a <code>GlobalPrivacyControl</code> or <code>DoNotTrack</code> signal, optional analytics and advertising scripts are automatically disabled.</li>
+        <li><strong>Web Fonts:</strong> Stylesheets loaded from Google Fonts use <code>referrerpolicy="no-referrer"</code> so article URLs are not leaked in font requests.</li>
